  Ändringar av FGF-begrepp föreslås via formuläret i begreppets uppgifter.
{% endif %}
</p>

{% elseif request.lang == 'en' %}

<p id="suggestion-link">
{% if request.vocabid == 'yso' %}
  You can suggest new concepts to YSO using <a href="yso/{{request.lang}}/#suggestion" target="_blank">the suggestion form</a>.
  If you wish to suggest a change to a concept in YSO, the form can be found among the information of the YSO concept.
{% elseif request.vocabid == 'yso-paikat'  %}
  You can suggest new concepts to YSO places using <a href="yso/{{request.lang}}/#suggestion" target="_blank">the suggestion form</a>.
  If you wish to suggest a change to a concept in YSO places, the form can be found among the information of the YSO places concept.
{% elseif request.vocabid == 'slm' %}
  You can suggest new concepts to SLM using <a href="yso/{{request.lang}}/#suggestion" target="_blank">the suggestion form</a>.
  If you wish to suggest a change to a concept in SLM, the form can be found among the information of the SLM concept.
{% endif %}
</p>

